error: [SemanticError GALA-E0015] $DIR/main.gala:5:17 bare `return` inside a match branch whose result is used as a value (hint: the match is wrapped in a function that must return string; in a function that returns nothing, initialize a `val` with the match first (a `return` in it then leaves the function), restructure to early-exit before the match, or use combinators like .Recover / .GetOrElse. See docs/errors/GALA-E0015.md)
